From 3873c51ce411e98107eebac7be8a0021375b43c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:29:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] platforms/nord-rrd: flash the open boot firmware images

With the open boot firmware, the TZ partitions hold the U-Boot SPL and
the UEFI partitions hold the FIT image it loads, while the devcfg
partitions are unused.

Point tz_{a,b} at u-boot-spl.mbn and uefi_{a,b} at boot_fit.img, and
leave devcfg_{a,b} without an image.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
